Hello, {0}!
An account has been created for you in the AutoElite driving school system. To sign in, set your password using this link: {1}
The link is valid for a limited time. If it has expired, ask the school to send the invitation again. If you did not expect this email, simply ignore it.

Hello, {0}!
We received a request to reset the password of your AutoElite account. To set a new password, use this link: {1}
The link is valid for a limited time. If you did not ask to reset your password, ignore this email: your password stays the same.
